      "id": "claim_32ae60de05f24511801b6cd8198add64",
      "statement": "All API requests pass through a common handler pipeline — BodyHandler, ResponseTimeHandler, TimeoutHandler, RequestLoggingHandler, ClientAuthorizationHandler — before reaching the endpoint handler, and are finalized by either ResponseHandler on success or ExceptionHandler on failure, as wired in PSPConnectorVertical.start().",
